        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Raguang ram dam adi gai cho?",
            "Kata luina dam chui lou the;",
            "Kaban siam ruang khou thuk lianga,",
            "Mansei tihei damchui lou the.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Pouhta thuan o kasuai hiam tiloumei,",
            "Panti gaimei tiloumei hei kasuaihiam e;",
            "Raguang ramjian kandih khou hei,",
            "Padik khuan e,",
            "Raguang ramjian tiloumei taThuan ku dikho.",
            "",
            "2. Raguang latdan piumei guai ta,",
            "Tingsang ringmmei ti khang rian lou;",
            "Nchummei gaimei tanmei guai,",
            "Tingsang guangdih khou lung puni.",
            "",
            "3. Kandih tanduan luai guang pu khou,",
            "Nkham pui gan guang pukhou kiu;",
            "Niu @&4 tan loumei tan guai tei,",
            "Raguang @&4 suan ti puni the."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
